#. module: cyllo_asset_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:cyllo_asset_management.mail_template_asset_rental
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    I hope this email finds you well. We are pleased to confirm the Rental arrangement for the\n"
"                    following asset:\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Asset Name:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    Rental Start Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('start_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Rental End Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    As per the agreement, please ensure timely payment of the lease fees and adhere to the terms\n"
"                    outlined therein.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Should you have any questions or require further clarification regarding the lease\n"
"                    agreement, feel free to contact us at your convenience.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n<div>Estimado/a <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t><br/><br/>Nos complace confirmar el alquiler del siguiente activo:<br/><br/>Nombre del activo: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t><br/>Fecha de inicio del alquiler: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('start_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Fecha de finalización del alquiler: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>De acuerdo con lo pactado, realice puntualmente el pago de las cuotas y cumpla las condiciones establecidas.<br/><br/>Si tiene alguna pregunta o necesita más información sobre el contrato, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros.<br/><br/>Si necesita ayuda, estamos a su disposición.<br/><br/>Atentamente,<br/></div>\n</div>"

#. module: cyllo_asset_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:cyllo_asset_management.mail_template_asset_leasing
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    I hope this email finds you well. We are pleased to confirm the leasing arrangement for the\n"
"                    following asset:\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Asset Name:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    Lease Start Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('start_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Lease End Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    As per the agreement, please ensure timely payment of the lease fees and adhere to the terms\n"
"                    outlined therein.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Should you have any questions or require further clarification regarding the lease\n"
"                    agreement, feel free to contact us at your convenience.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n<div>Estimado/a <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t><br/><br/>Nos complace confirmar el arrendamiento del siguiente activo:<br/><br/>Nombre del activo: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t><br/>Fecha de inicio del arrendamiento: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('start_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Fecha de finalización del arrendamiento: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>De acuerdo con lo pactado, realice puntualmente el pago de las cuotas y cumpla las condiciones establecidas.<br/><br/>Si tiene alguna pregunta o necesita más información sobre el contrato, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros.<br/><br/>Si necesita ayuda, estamos a su disposición.<br/><br/>Atentamente,<br/></div>\n</div>"

#. module: cyllo_asset_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:cyllo_asset_management.mail_template_leased_assent_return_reminder
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    This is a friendly reminder regarding the return of the leased asset,\n"
"                    <b>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    </b>\n"
"                    , which is due\n"
"                    for return as per our lease agreement on\n"
"                    <b>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    </b>\n"
"                    .\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Please ensure that the asset is returned on or before the specified return date to avoid any\n"
"                    potential late fees or penalties as outlined in our agreement.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n<div>Estimado/a <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t><br/><br/>Le recordamos que debe devolver el activo arrendado <b><t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\">,</t></b> en la fecha acordada, <b><t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\">,</t></b>.<br/><br/>Devuelva el activo a más tardar en la fecha indicada para evitar cargos por demora u otras penalizaciones previstas en el contrato.<br/><br/>Si tiene alguna pregunta o necesita ayuda, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros.<br/><br/>Atentamente,<br/></div>\n</div>"

#. module: cyllo_asset_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:cyllo_asset_management.mail_template_assent_rental_invoice_due_reminder
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    This is a friendly reminder regarding the upcoming payment for the rental asset invoice.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    As per our agreement, the payment for the asset\n"
"                    <b>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    </b>is due on\n"
"                    <b><t t-out=\"ctx.get('due_date') or not_available\">,</t></b>\n"
"                    . However, it appears that\n"
"                    the payment has not yet been received.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Please ensure that the payment is made promptly to avoid any late fees or disruptions to your rental\n"
"                    agreement. Your cooperation in this matter is greatly appreciated.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have already made the payment, please disregard this reminder, and kindly inform us of the\n"
"                    transaction details for our records.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr "<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding:0px;\">\n<div>Estimado/a <t t-out=\"ctx.get('customer') or not_available\">,</t><br/><br/>Le recordamos que el pago de la factura del alquiler del activo <b><t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t></b> vence el <b><t t-out=\"ctx.get('due_date') or not_available\">,</t></b>. Según nuestros registros, aún no hemos recibido el pago.<br/><br/>Realice el pago lo antes posible para evitar recargos por demora o interrupciones del contrato de alquiler. Agradecemos su colaboración.<br/><br/>Si ya realizó el pago, ignore este aviso y comuníquenos los datos de la transacción para actualizar nuestros registros.<br/><br/>Si tiene alguna pregunta o necesita ayuda, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros.<br/><br/>Atentamente,<br/></div>\n</div>"

#. module: cyllo_asset_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:cyllo_asset_management.mail_template_asset_assignment
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('employee') or not_available\">,</t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    I hope this email finds you well.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    I am pleased to inform you that the following asset have been assigned to you:\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Asset Name:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Assign Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('assign_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Please take good care of the assigned asset and ensure they are used responsibly in accordance\n"
"                    with our organization's policies and guidelines.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Should you encounter any issues or have any\n"
"                    questions regarding the assigned asset, please feel free to reach out to us for assistance.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr "<div><div>Estimado/a <t t-out=\"ctx.get('employee') or not_available\">,</t><br/><br/>Le informamos de que se le ha asignado el siguiente activo:<br/><br/>Nombre del activo: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Fecha de asignación: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('assign_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Cuide el activo asignado y utilícelo de forma responsable, de acuerdo con las políticas y directrices de la organización.<br/><br/>Si tiene algún problema o pregunta sobre el activo, póngase en contacto con nosotros para recibir ayuda.<br/><br/>Atentamente,<br/></div></div>"

#. module: cyllo_asset_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:cyllo_asset_management.mail_template_asset_reservation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Dear\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('employee') or not_available\">,</t>,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    I hope this email finds you well.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    This is to confirm that your reservation for the following asset has been successfully processed:\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Asset Name:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Reservation start Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('start_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Reservation End Date:\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\"></t>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Please ensure to adhere to the reservation schedule.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    If you have any questions or need further assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                    <br>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr "<div><div>Estimado/a <t t-out=\"ctx.get('employee') or not_available\">,</t><br/><br/>Le confirmamos que se ha procesado correctamente la reserva del siguiente activo:<br/><br/>Nombre del activo: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('asset') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Inicio de la reserva: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('start_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Fin de la reserva: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('end_date') or not_available\"></t><br/><br/>Respete el período de reserva indicado.<br/><br/>Si tiene alguna pregunta o necesita ayuda, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros.<br/><br/>Atentamente,<br/></div></div>"

